{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"一、八年。春，陳侯之弟招殺陳世子偃師。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"二、夏四月辛丑，陳侯溺卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"三、叔弓如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"四、楚人執陳行人于徵師殺之。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"五、陳公子留出奔鄭。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"六、秋，蒐于紅。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"蒐者何？簡車徒也。何以書？蓋以罕書也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"七、陳人殺其大夫公子過。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"八、大雩。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"九、冬十月壬午，楚師滅陳，執陳公子招，放之于越，殺陳孔瑗。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_188_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_188","textTraditional":"十、葬陳哀公。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}